				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "IA/U1I3ySg2olKi77DnC9A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# The weak part"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:36:49.908057+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:36:49.908057+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "VxXG21F/TM6aGj1YYmwCiw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "All changes and the matching of announcements run under the registry's lock; delivery to the matched subscriptions and the size queries ({{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry>>#numberOfSubscriptions|label=#selector}}, {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry>>#isEmpty|label=#selector}}) do not. The GT views and the announcer graph read the subscriptions under the lock too."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:36:51.821676+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:36:51.821676+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "Ic3oC1OFTxyRildzt/VwCA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The cleanup of dead subscribers also takes the lock, and it runs in the finalization process. While a lower-priority process holds the lock, for example while matching code such as a {{gtMethod:Announcement class>>#where:|label=#selector}} condition runs or halts in a debugger, the finalization process waits, and with it all finalization in the image. Pharo's registries have the same exposure: {{gtMethod:WeakAnnouncementSubscription>>#finalize}} takes the registry's lock as well."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:29:59.466014+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:36:51.828671+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "p8gHVYloTv2K8PzUGib2dQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "- {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#everyChangeOfTheRegistryWaitsForItsLock}} holds the lock and starts each kind of change in a process of higher priority; each must wait. {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#matchingHoldsTheLockAndDeliveryDoesNot}} does the same from inside a {{gtMethod:Announcement class>>#where:|label=#selector}} condition and from inside a handler.\n- {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#everyChangeOfTheRegistryIsNoted}} goes through every kind of change and checks that each stores a new change marker, and that delivering and querying do not.\n- {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#concurrentWeakSubscriptionsKeepTheRegistryConsistent}} and {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#concurrentMourningKeepsAResubscribingSubscriber}} run busy and timer-driven workers at different priorities, a reader, a copier and a scavenger for three seconds. They are statistical; longer soak runs with random changes, deliveries and {{gtMethod:Announcement class>>#where:|label=#selector}} conditions that change the registry did hundreds of thousands of rounds without an error, and every announcement reached each subscriber exactly once."
						}
					]
				},
