				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Behaviour shared with Pharo's registries"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:38:31.697294+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:38:55.586167+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "wPFoTtZ4SJCiqN9iKsPQmg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "- Old-style weak subscriptions moved into a mixed registry keep their global entry; install the registry before subscribing.\n- {{gtMethod:Announcer>>#useSubscriptionRegistry:}} locks only the old registry: a subscribe or unsubscribe made by another process during the switch can end up in the old registry. Moving to a plain registry turns weak block subscriptions into strong ones.\n- A process terminated in the middle of a change can lose that subscriber's group.\n- A copy of a registry shares its subscription objects with the original: {{gtMethod:GtEphemeronAnnouncementSubscription>>#makeStrong|label=#selector}} of one of them replaces it in both, and in the copy the strong subscription then sits in a weak group.\n- A weak subscription removed from its announcer before the announcer moved to a plain registry cannot be made strong or given another subscriber any more: the plain registry does not understand {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry>>#makeStrong:for:|label=#selector}} and {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry>>#changeSubscriberOf:to:|label=#selector}}."
						}
					]
				},
